<title>INDIA: Indian Shipping - Tuticorin cargoes - Jan 22.</title>
<headline>Indian Shipping - Tuticorin cargoes - Jan 22.</headline>
<dateline>BOMBAY 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Following is the berthing schedule of major vessels loading and unloading at India's Tuticorin port on January 22:</p>
<p> Commodity	    Tons/TEUS		 Ship	    Berthing</p>
<p>		   (LDD/ULD) (Balance)</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>Raw Cashewnuts 1,605/--- (ULD) 2,475/---  Komsomolets A.   20/01</p>
<p>Raw Cashewnuts   381/--- (ULD) 7,440/---  Alhafizu	   21/01</p>
<p>Rock Phosphate 5,570/--- (ULD) 1,730/---  Smena		18/01</p>
<p>Coal	     2,832/--- (ULD)22,456/---  Tamil Anna	 22/01</p>
<p>Coal	    19,664/--- (ULD)   100/---  Maratha Prudence 19/01</p>
<p>Naphtha	  5,600/--- (ULD) 3,400/---  Aurobindo	  20/01</p>
<p>----------------------------------------------------------------</p>
<p>	    Note:</p>
<p>	    LDD - Loading</p>
<p>	    ULD - Unloading</p>
<p>	   (Source: J.M.Baxi &amp; Co, Tuticorin)</p>
